1
00:00:00,067 --> 00:00:04,267
Pernah nggak sih ketiduran pas lagi nonton,

2
00:00:04,267 --> 00:00:08,000
tapi laptopnya masih nyala semalaman?

3
00:00:08,267 --> 00:00:10,867
Atau malah sebaliknya, udah ngantuk,

4
00:00:10,867 --> 00:00:13,500
tapi download belum selesai?

5
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,500
Emang ada solusinya?

6
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:19,567
Tenang,

7
00:00:19,633 --> 00:00:21,967
kamu bisa atur laptop

8
00:00:22,033 --> 00:00:25,733
biar mati sendiri secara otomatis.

9
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,067
Caranya gampang.

10
00:00:28,100 --> 00:00:30,233
Tekan Windows + R,

11
00:00:30,267 --> 00:00:33,967
lalu ketik perintah ini,

12
00:00:34,033 --> 00:00:36,000
lalu klik OK.

13
00:00:36,133 --> 00:00:39,467
Angka 3600 itu artinya satu jam.

14
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:41,133
Kalau waktunya habis,

15
00:00:41,167 --> 00:00:43,500
laptop bakal mati sendiri.

16
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:45,267
Kalau mau batalin,

17
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:47,167
tinggal buka Run lagi,

18
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:50,233
ketik perintah ini,

19
00:00:50,267 --> 00:00:51,967
lalu Enter.

20
00:00:52,100 --> 00:00:54,833
Kalau kamu punya cara lain

21
00:00:54,867 --> 00:00:56,833
yang lebih praktis,

22
00:00:56,867 --> 00:01:00,000
coba share di kolom komentar!
